WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.835
-All right. Here's how it works,
we're gonna take turns

00:00:01.835 --> 00:00:02.635 line:92%
drawing one of these cards.

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:05.839 align:start size:94% position:6%
Each card has five totally
random questions on it.

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:08.274 align:start size:94% position:6%
One person asks the questions,
the other person

00:00:08.274 --> 00:00:11.211 align:start size:94% position:6%
has to answer each question
as soon as it's asked.

00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:12.779 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I mean immediately.
[ Vocalizes ]

00:00:12.779 --> 00:00:14.681 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right.
-It doesn't matter --

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:16.016 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Is there a record
that I'm trying to beat?

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:19.819 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause I work well if
I'm competing against someone.

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:22.022 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is there a...
-Yeah you have to answer

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:23.356 align:start size:94% position:6%
all of the questions.
-Okay.

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:24.157 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:24.157 --> 00:00:25.725
-Is there-- d--
-It doesn't matter if the answer

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:28.361 align:start size:94% position:6%
is right or wrong, it just has
to be the very first thing

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:30.397 align:start size:94% position:6%
that pops into your head.
No this is very --

00:00:30.397 --> 00:00:33.566 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Is there winning to this?
-Yes.

00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:34.567 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:36.970
-Because you're the guest, I'm
gonna read your questions first.

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:39.105 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But who's keeping score?
Is what I'm asking.

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:41.174
[ Laughter ]
-What till you see what happens.

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:43.043 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay. Okay. Okay.
-All right.

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:44.611 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here we go. Ready for this?
-Oh, God. Okay.

00:00:44.611 --> 00:00:46.746 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
-It's called think fast.

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:51.117
The lighting changed, thank you.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.752 --> 00:00:54.554 align:start size:94% position:6%
Who did you
invite to your party?

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:55.455 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Stammers ]
Ronald McDonald.

00:00:55.455 --> 00:00:57.457 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Why did you get kicked off
the airplane?

00:00:57.457 --> 00:00:59.392 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Because I drank all
the alcohol!

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:03.129 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What's over there?
-A lion and a tiger.

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:05.632 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What do The Roots do
on the weekend?

00:01:05.632 --> 00:01:07.267 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-Uh, sleep in, I hope.

00:01:07.267 --> 00:01:13.973 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Say something serious.
-Don't you dare try to tell me

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:17.143 align:start size:94% position:6%
what to say.
[ Bell dings ]

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:18.411 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow.
-Wow.

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:21.815
-All right. Nice job, Amy.
Turns out you won that round.

00:01:21.815 --> 00:01:23.516 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, good!
-Now -- Yeah. [ Laughs ]

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:25.785 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah it's easy to tell.
I got seven.

00:01:25.785 --> 00:01:27.654 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It is my -- That sound means
you won the round.

00:01:27.654 --> 00:01:28.855 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I got seven.
-Uh, yeah.

00:01:28.855 --> 00:01:31.257
Now it's my turn. Whenever
you're ready, take the card.

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:32.292 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right.
-And go for it, yeah?

00:01:32.292 --> 00:01:34.094 size:84% position:42%
-Here we go. All right.
-All right. Here we go.

00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:35.128 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ]
-Oh, my God.

00:01:35.128 --> 00:01:36.329 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay, okay, okay. Here we go.
-Yeah.

00:01:36.329 --> 00:01:37.397 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You ready, Jimmy?
-Yeah.

00:01:37.397 --> 00:01:41.801 align:start size:94% position:6%
