00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:42.502 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Uh, Beezles.

00:01:42.502 --> 00:01:45.271 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Who c--
Who can you always trust?

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:47.173 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-Uh, George Sampson.

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:51.344 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What's the capital of Earth?
-Uh, You-Nigh-Gid.

00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:53.179 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-You-Nigh-Gid?

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:55.682 align:start size:94% position:6%
When is tomorrow?
-Tomorrow?

00:01:55.682 --> 00:01:57.350 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.350 --> 00:01:58.885 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-How do you dance?

00:01:58.885 --> 00:02:00.353 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
