00:02:00.353 --> 00:02:02.055 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
[ Bell dings ]

00:02:02.055 --> 00:02:03.723 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-You do dance like that.

00:02:03.723 --> 00:02:06.459 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Ooh. I just got it.
-You-Nigh-Gid.

00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:07.527 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You-Nigh-Gid.
-You-Nigh-Gid.

00:02:07.527 --> 00:02:10.029
-The Capital of Earth, I didn't
know what was happening.

00:02:10.029 --> 00:02:12.198 align:start size:94% position:6%
All right. It's time for the
final round though.

00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:13.199 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-In this round, we'll both

00:02:13.199 --> 00:02:15.034
