00:02:22.275 --> 00:02:24.043 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughing ] Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.043 --> 00:02:25.078 align:start size:94% position:6%
All right.
-Oh, hoo!

00:02:25.078 --> 00:02:25.879 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-Here we go.

00:02:25.879 --> 00:02:29.215
Now will I go first or I'll ask
the first question.

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:30.083 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay.

00:02:30.083 --> 00:02:32.185 align:start size:94% position:6%
I just want to find,
I just want to find my center.

00:02:32.185 --> 00:02:33.920 align:start size:94% position:6%
And just kind of get to the
space a little.

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:35.255 align:start size:94% position:6%
